"""Part 8e-iv mutations: the camera's placement and move, the view's choice, the special modes
(and C_Car::HasSeatCamera / GetCameraOffset).

Run with the camera build: --build build_camera.bat --check check_camera.py (CAMERA_TEST; the
checks in placement_test.inc). The deletions are named by the line before the one they delete.

Equivalent (left alive, by design):
  C 1331 cmp, 1360 cmp   the turn's aside angle exactly 0.08 (a double): not reached.
  C 1352 cmp, 1689 cmp   a turn's ratio exactly 1: clamped to 1 either way.
  C 1430 cmp, 1434 cmp, 1442 cmp, 1455 cmp, 1457 cmp, 1464 cmp   the distance's clamps at exactly
                         their limit: the limit either way.
  C 1466 cmp             the distance exactly unknown04 there: taken by the branch before it
                         (not under water); under water the clause is skipped.
  C 1501 cmp / num, 1507 cmp   the blend time ending exactly at 0 (an int: 0 either way).
  C 1520 num             the sway's first value: only seen before the first view mode 2 sets it
                         (the harness sets it before its checks; it persists across missions).
  C 1538 cmp / num, 1542 del   the shake's time ending exactly at 0: the sines of 0 are 0, as
                         the zeroing.
  C 1584 arith, 1587 arith   the sway's side axis' y is always 0.
  C 1593 cmp, 1595 cmp, 1598 cmp, 1600 cmp, 1598 num   the sway at exactly its limits; past
                         0.008 it is clamped to 0.008 either way.
  C 1643 cmp, 1644 cmp   the fade's distance exactly 1.2 / 0.2: the same fade.
  C 1651 cmp, 1653 cmp, 1657 cmp   the fade equal to its target: not reached (!=) / clamped.
  C 1814 num             any negative blend time ends the same way (0, unknown08).
  C 1922 num, 1965 num   SelectView's argument is not used.
  C 1974 cmp / num / arith   the direction's kick of unit length: longer than 0.25 anyway.
  C 1988 cmp / arith     the position's kick of unit length: not longer than 1 anyway.
"""
